  // and summing O through SLM. The missing-reduction diagnosis was wrong.
  //
  // MEASURED AND REJECTED anyway, kept default-off (=1) as a recorded refutation.
  // N_SPLIT=2 compiles but *hangs* (RC=124) at the smallest verify shape, with
