  // halves each subgroup's K-sequence slice but leaves its Q rows -- and therefore the
  // full-height O accumulator -- untouched, while doubling the subgroups that each need
  // one. Spill goes from ~700 B/thread to 6656-12672 at TILED_OUT=256 and
  // 24704-26944 at TILED_OUT=512. The prize was the 3.3 TFLOPS the pin-K probe
  // measured; 6-27 KB/thread of spill costs far more (cf. TILED_KV=128, TILED_Q=512).
